ived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":11,"created_at":"2026-01-20T16:57:05Z","updated_at":"2026-02-16T09:05:10Z","closed_at":"2026-02-14T20:33:04Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.6.rc1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.rc1 - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8142) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600X 6-Core Processor (12 threads) - 63.92 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nApplying rotation to Kinematic RigidBody is bugged for Jolt Physics 3D, while GodotPhysics works\n\n1. Body doesn't rotate when angle is low and collision shape position is (0,0,0) (my experiments show `0.001` or lower)\n```\nextends RigidBody3D\n\n\nfunc _physics_process(delta: float) -> void:\n\t#rotate_y(deg_to_rad(10 * delta)) # this rotates in both Jolt and GodotPhysics\n\trotate_y(deg_to_rad(1 * delta)) # this doesn't in Jolt\n```\nIt looks like Jolt does a rotation only in a first frame, but I'm not sure.\n\nBody in GodotPhysics rotates as expected:\n\n[!Godot](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d1774892-3bd8-4275-ace2-5e1ceceff64a)\n\n---\n\n2. Rotation is incorrect if CollisionShape is offset from RigidBody3D origin. RigidBody is not rotated, but moved linearly (or rotation is offset from origin when applying higher angle: `rotate_y(deg_to_rad(10 * delta))`)\n\nThis is recording for GodotPhysics, collision shape is red, code is same as above:\n\n[!Godot](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f7dc48b6-8bf8-4447-899d-0022923dcca6)\n\nAnd this is Jolt:\n\n[!Jolt](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1c2310dc-07e2-44cd-a258-e93d4eeed157)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nLaunch scene from MRP with GodotPhysics and then with JoltPhysics\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[new-game-project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24742915/new-game-project.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"patrykkalinowski","id":7796424,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTY0MjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7796424?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski","html_url":"https://github.com/patrykkalinowski","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115180/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"t